        {
          "id": "d12-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q1 2026, management expects modest sequential growth with flat headcount. Capital expenditure for Q1 2026 is budgeted at $21.3M, the majority allocated to edge infrastructure.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
